{
  "nl": "续费提醒管理：查询有账户名称；表格展示账户名称、套餐、席位、优惠码、续费代金券；支持新增、编辑、删除。表单里「续费代金券」在套餐为试用版，或席位不超过 5 个且未填优惠码时隐藏。",
  "nlEn": "Renewal-reminder management: query by account name; the table shows account name, plan, seats, coupon code and renewal voucher; supports add, edit and delete. In the form, the \"renewal voucher\" is hidden when the plan is trial, or the seats are at most 5 and no coupon code has been entered.",
  "fixedFields": ["accountName", "plan", "seats", "couponCode", "renewalVoucher"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "isHidden:renewalVoucher"],
  "config": {
    "name": "RenewalReminderManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/renewal-reminders",
    "target": "vue3",
    "fields": [
      { "prop": "accountName", "label": "账户名称", "formtype": "Input" },
      {
        "prop": "plan",
        "label": "套餐",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "dataOptions": [
          { "label": "试用版", "value": "trial" },
          { "label": "标准版", "value": "std" },
          { "label": "企业版", "value": "ent" }
        ],
        "inQuery": false
      },
      { "prop": "seats", "label": "席位", "formtype": "InputNumber", "inQuery": false },
      { "prop": "couponCode", "label": "优惠码", "formtype": "Input", "inQuery": false },
      {
        "prop": "renewalVoucher",
        "label": "续费代金券",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "isHidden": {
          "or": [
            { "==": [{ "var": "plan" }, "trial"] },
            {
              "and": [
                { "<=": [{ "var": "seats" }, 5] },
                { "empty": [{ "var": "couponCode" }] }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "actions": ["add", "edit", "delete"]
  },
  "notes": "AI-16: 表达式 isHidden（or + and + 序关系 <= + empty）—— 试用版或（席位<=5 且无优惠码）时隐藏续费代金券（vue3/schema）"
}
